WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.252 --> 00:00:09.931
Meet Lapi. Your documents, spreadsheets, databases and apps, connected
into one knowledge base, so you can simply ask.

2
00:00:09.981 --> 00:00:21.832
Add knowledge in seconds: upload files, snap a photo on your phone, or connect
cloud storage like Google Drive and SharePoint. A step-by-step guide helps with each one.

3
00:00:21.882 --> 00:00:30.113
Lapi reads every page, even scans, and keeps it
all in datasets, indexed with the models your administrator chose.

4
00:00:30.163 --> 00:00:37.170
Then just ask, in plain words. Every answer
shows its sources, so you can check it.

5
00:00:37.220 --> 00:00:45.452
Need data out? Lapi suggests the fields, pulls them
out, and you review each value next to its source.

6
00:00:45.502 --> 00:00:54.592
Teach the agent with skills: a short playbook for a kind
of document. Add one once, and Lapi uses it whenever it fits.

7
00:00:54.642 --> 00:01:05.025
Single sign-on, access per dataset, and an activity log keep
everything safe. You're ready. Start with Quick start on your dashboard.
